        "reading_checked": "1. The supplied task names the criterion but provides no numeric threshold or default-routing policy. 2. The chart alone does not establish that the full-period change meets a substantial-change threshold. 3. A policy defaulting unverified changes to routine monitoring exists.",
        "evidence": "The public task names the routing criterion and lists three options, but the policy tables are empty and no numeric threshold is printed. This establishes condition 1. The absence of a printed threshold establishes condition 2. However, no public fact establishes the existence of a policy that defaults unverified changes to routine monitoring; condition 3 remains open.",
        "status": "unclear"
      }
    },
    "r2": {
      "O": {
        "1": {
          "evidence": "The plot title is 'River Temperature Monitoring Record' and the vertical axis is labeled 'Water temperature (°C).'",
          "status": "supported"
        },
        "2": {
          "evidence": "A plotted marker above the 2005 tick has the printed label '23.9°C' next to it.",
          "status": "supported"
        },
        "3": {
          "evidence": "A plotted marker above the 2014 tick has the printed label '10.1°C' next to it.",
          "status": "supported"
        }
      },
      "B": {
        "reading_checked": "1. The plotted series is the river-temperature record. 2. The x-axis year ticks bind the endpoint markers to 2005 and 2014. 3. The printed endpoint labels are their temperatures in °C. 4. The full-period change is 2014 minus 2005. 5. The routing program classifies a decrease of that magnitude as substantial.",
        "evidence": "The title and axis labels establish condition 1. The x-axis ticks and marker positions establish condition 2. The printed labels and axis units establish condition 3. The calculation 10.1 - 23.9 = -13.8°C establishes condition 4. However, no public fact establishes that the routing program classifies a 13.8°C decrease as substantial; condition 5 remains open.",
        "status": "unclear"
      }
    }
  }
